### Budget API Testing


### Base URL

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001


### ============================================


### Authentication


### ============================================


### Login

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "your-email@example.com",
  "password": "your-password"
}


### Register

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### ============================================


### Expense Categories


### ============================================


### Create Expense Category

POST {{baseUrl}}/budget/expense-categories HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

{
  "name": "Food & Dining",
  "color": "#FF5733",
  "icon": "utensils"
}


### List Expense Categories

GET {{baseUrl}}/budget/expense-categories HTTP/1.1
X-User-ID: {{userId}}


### Update Expense Category

PUT {{baseUrl}}/budget/expense-categories/{category_id} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

{
  "name": "Food & Dining (Updated)",
  "color": "#FF0000",
  "icon": "utensils"
}


### Delete Expense Category

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/budget/expense-categories/{category_id} HTTP/1.1
X-User-ID: {{userId}}


